.TH bhtune-opc-browse 1  "bhtune-opc-browse "
.SH NAME
bhtune\-opc\-browse \- Browse one bounded page of tags. Without a session, lists the root level
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-opc\-browse\fR [\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-parent\-node\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-refresh\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Browse one bounded page of tags. Without a session, lists the root level
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR \fI<BRIDGE_HOST>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<SERVER>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-session\-id\fR \fI<SESSION_ID>\fR
Existing bridge browse session to continue or use with `parent\-node\-key`
.TP
\fB\-\-parent\-node\-key\fR \fI<PARENT_NODE_KEY>\fR
Opaque node key returned by a previous page
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-token\fR \fI<PAGE_TOKEN>\fR
Opaque continuation token returned by a previous page
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-size\fR \fI<PAGE_SIZE>\fR [default: 200]
Number of immediate children to request
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Follow continuation pages until the requested level is complete
.TP
\fB\-\-refresh\fR
Ask the gateway to refresh its namespace view
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
